   ["1999 · Ulysses strikes","The asteroid breaks apart and its fragments fall from July 8. About 500,000 people die in the first two weeks and at least a million are displaced. Economists put the damage at 18 months of Usea's total GDP. Stonehenge intercepts many fragments but not all. Farbanti and Newfield Island are radically altered; Anchorhead, Saint Ark and Comberth Harbor are unharmed."],
