 {id:"ac04",code:"04",title:"Ace Combat 04: Shattered Skies",year:2003,war:"Continental War",kind:"game",player:"Mobius 1 · ISAF",
  summary:"After the Ulysses fragments killed over half a million Useans in 1999, every country agreed to take in a share of refugees. In April 2003 Erusea stopped, citing its own rebuilding. Other nations boycotted its exports while refugees starved at its borders, and that summer Erusea invaded San Salvacion and seized Stonehenge, turning the anti-asteroid railguns on aircraft. The Independent State Allied Forces (ISAF) were driven back to North Point, rebuilt, and fought their way back across Usea. Erusea surrendered on September 19, 2005, after the fall of Farbanti.",
