  events:{erusea:"Stops taking Ulysses refugees in April 2003, then invades San Salvacion and seizes Stonehenge. Its Yellow Squadron dominates the skies and its Aegir Fleet threatens North Point, but ISAF wears it down. It surrenders on September 19, 2005, after Farbanti falls and its Supreme Commander is killed. Rebel officers make a last stand at the Megalith, and Free Erusea rises against the reformed government in 2006.",
