 {id:"ac5",code:"5",title:"Ace Combat 5: The Unsung War",year:2010,war:"Circum-Pacific War",kind:"game",player:"Blaze · Wardog / Razgriz",
  summary:"After the Belkan War, Osea and Yuktobania spent fifteen years as partners, building the Arkbird spaceplane and the Basset Space Center together. The Grey Men, a Belkan supremacist cabal of businessmen and politicians, set out to avenge 1995 by turning the two superpowers against each other. Yuktobania declared war on September 27, 2010. Wardog Squadron fought from Sand Island until it was branded a traitor, then returned unmarked as the Razgriz, exposed the plot, and stopped the Grey Men's satellite weapon. The war ended on December 30, 2010.",
  cast:[["WARDOG","Blaze, Kei Nagase, Hans Grimm, Alvin H. 'Chopper' Davenport; later Marcus Snow as Razgriz"],["OSEA","President Vincent Harling, instructor Jack Bartlett"],["YUKTOBANIA","Prime Minister Seryozha Nikanor, Nastasya Obertas; submarines Scinfaxi and Hrimfaxi"],["GREY MEN","Belkan cabal incl. Gründer CEO Solare Ostberg; Ofnir and Grabacr squadrons posing as the '8492nd'"],["WEAPONS","Arkbird, SOLG orbital gun, V2"]],
  beats:["Background: The Grey Men take control of sites on the Belka–Osea border, including Mount Schirm, Stier Castle and the munitions factory that became Gründer Industries.",
   "Sep 23–27, 2010: Unknown fighters attack Wardog's training flight near Cape Landers. Kei Nagase and instructor Jack Bartlett survive. On Sep 27 Bartlett goes missing after shielding Nagase, and Yuktobania declares war.",
   "Late September: Yuktobania hits the port of St. Hewlett and bombs Sand Island. On Sep 30 the submarine Scinfaxi's burst missiles sink the carriers Vulture and Buzzard in the Eaglin Straits.",
   "Oct 3–4: Wardog guards a launch to the Arkbird and repels a landing on Sand Island. The Arkbird helps sink Scinfaxi.",
   "Oct 22: Osean air defences fire on President Harling's plane at Akerson Hill and he disappears for two months. In Yuktobania, Nikanor is ousted in a coup.",
   "Oct 31: Operation Footprint puts Osean troops ashore on the Bastok Peninsula.",
   "Early November: The '8492nd Squadron' attacks a college in Dresdene. Yuktobanian special forces hit Apito airport and gas Bana City; Osea answers with secret strikes on Duga and Sonza.",
   "Mid-November: Wardog sinks Hrimfaxi and earns the name 'Demons of Razgriz'. Osea pushes across the Jilachi Desert toward Cinigrad.",
   "Nov 29: Yuktobanian aircraft attack a peace ceremony in November City. Chopper is killed.",
   "Early December: After the breakthrough at Cruik Fortress, the 8492nd ambushes Wardog, Sand Island is tricked into treating them as traitors, and the pilots are listed as killed in action.",
   "December: Flying as the Razgriz with Marcus Snow, the survivors rescue Harling from Stier Castle, seal the Mount Schirm mine, stop a stolen nuke, and shoot down the Arkbird after the Grey Men seize it. They help Bartlett, Nastasya Obertas and Nikanor escape.",
   "Dec 29: Nikanor calls for peace. The Razgriz protect Yuktobanian ships that answer him and the Kestrel's fleet from attackers on both sides.",
   "Dec 30: A decoded disc reveals the Grey Men's V2 plan. The Razgriz destroy the SOLG controls in Gründer's Sudentor tunnel, shoot down Ofnir and Grabacr, and destroy the SOLG as it falls toward Oured.",
   "Aftermath: Harling and Nikanor make peace in Oured. Harling later promises to release the war's records in 2020; Free Erusea rises again in 2014."],
  roles:{osea:"friendly",yuktobania:"hostile",belka:"hostile",erusea:"involved"},
  events:{osea:"Wardog, flying from Sand Island, fights through the first months, sinks Hrimfaxi, and is then branded traitor and listed as dead. The survivors fight on as the Razgriz, rescue President Harling from Stier Castle and stop the SOLG from falling on the capital Oured. Harling and Nikanor make peace in Oured.",
   yuktobania:"Declares war on September 27, 2010. Its burst-missile submarines Scinfaxi and Hrimfaxi wreck Osean fleets. Prime Minister Nikanor is ousted while hardliners fight on; freed with the Razgriz's help, he calls for peace on December 29 and settles it with Harling.",
