 {id:"sy10",code:"INC",title:"Sotoa–Yuktobanian War",year:2010,war:"Sotoa vs Yuktobania, around 2010",kind:"incident",tag:"WIKI",
  summary:"A war between the Republic of Sotoa and the Union of Yuktobanian Republics, fought around 2010 and about twenty years before the Sotoa–Usea War. Carmille Tewy, from the Sotoan family that founded the Sotoa Air Force, flew in it as Moon 11. She became an ace and was hailed as Sotoa's greatest pilot. She also fought a duel with a female Yuktobanian ace in which both were shot down. Both survived, but their injuries ended their flying careers.",
