   "Feb 2016: Battalions trapped near Silvat Town are relieved, the Selumna Peaks are crossed, and San Loma is retaken on February 15.",
   "Feb 2016: Emmeria ambushes the Aerial Fleet refuelling over the Fuscum Sea. Talisman destroys the Aigaion, ending the Nimbus threat.",
   "Mar 6, 2016: Special forces use tunnels to help capture Ragno Fortress in Grageo Canyon.",
   "Mar 25, 2016: Emmeria overruns the Estovakian Army in the Moloch Desert, one of the war's largest battles, then pauses on learning of a plan to move weapons-of-mass-destruction catalysts into Gracemeria.",
   "Late Mar 2016: Garuda Team destroys the catalyst convoy near the Alma River.",
   "Mar 31, 2016: Operation Free Gracemeria liberates the capital. Talisman shoots down Ilya Pasternak. That night, officers opposed to the ceasefire fire the Chandelier at the celebrating city.",
   "Apr 1, 2016: The Chandelier is found north of Sonne Island and destroyed. Gustav Dvornik and the last Strigon pilots are shot down. A coup in Estovakia topples The Generals.",
