  roles:{emmeria:"friendly",estovakia:"hostile",nordennavic:"involved",belka:"involved"},
  events:{emmeria:"Prepared well for Ulysses and helped Estovakia rebuild, then is invaded on August 30, 2015 and loses Gracemeria and San Loma. Regrouping on Khesed Island, Garuda Team leads the counter-offensive back across Anea. Gracemeria is freed on March 31, 2016, and the Chandelier is destroyed the next day.",
   estovakia:"Wrecked by Ulysses after its Chandelier railgun came too late. The Eastern Faction wins the civil war and its military government, The Generals, invades Emmeria. After defeat in the Moloch Desert and the loss of the Aigaion and Chandelier, a coup in its capital overthrows The Generals and it signs a ceasefire in May 2016, badly weakened.",
