s the stolen XB-0 to attack Lumen and Valais; Galm Team shoots it down.", "m"], ["Belkan War · 1995", "Dec 31", "AWWNB tries to launch a V2 from Avalon Dam. Operations Thunderbolt and Point Blank destroy the control devices; Cipher defeats Foulke and the V2 detonates harmlessly.", "w"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "1996", "Waldemarr Rald and his faction are ousted from Belkan politics over ties to AWWNB. Blauvelt reforms the Belkan Air Force. Surviving Wizard Squadron members are killed or captured after a plot against Osea's president.", "m"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "Apr 18, 1996", "Robert Tyler becomes FCU Chief of Staff.", "m"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "Apr 20, 1996", "The FCU announces Ulysses, orders overseas troops home, restricts communications and begins planning an NMD response. Refugees begin leaving Usea.", "w"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "1997", "Heinrich Koenig is linked to the Falcons of Dawn (May).", "n"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "May 30, 1997", "The Usean rebellion begins and the Allies retreat west.", "w"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "1998", "Yuktobania starts Project Alicorn. Belkan aces serve as aggressors for other militaries (8492nd and Ofnir Squadrons). Erusean Air and Space Administration starts developing the X-02.", "m"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "Mar 20, 1998", "Operation Fighter's Honor: Scarface Squadron is hired; Phoenix protects the Twinkle Islands.", "w"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "Apr 5, 1998", "Operation Anchorhead Freedom retakes Anchorhead.", "n"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "Apr 14, 1998", "The Keep and Opera House are destroyed; John Hervard and Kei Nagase join Phoenix.", "m"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "Jun 19, 1998", "Stonehenge base construction is completed.", "m"], ["Aftermath and the Usean coup · 1996–1999", "Jul 7, 1998", "Scarface